    "en": {
      "text": "Passively grants 75% Damage Resistance against explosive self-damage.\n\nThe following actions charge up Blastwave Striders:\n• <link Minor [#CombatantClassifications] /> PVE Combatant Kills: 10%\n• <link Elite or higher tier [#CombatantClassifications] /> PVE Combatant Kills: 25%\n• Enemy Guardians: 20%\n• Collecting <exotic Alethonym />'s Vestiges: 10%\n\nWhile at 100% charge, deal damage with <stasis/>Shiver Strike, <stasis/>Howl of The Storm, or explosive self-damage to propel yourself backwards in an explosive jump, releasing 8 <stasis/>Stasis Shrapnel Projectiles and granting 5 <stasis/>Frost Armor Stacks. Each Projectile deals <pve 623 /> <pvp [?] /> damage and spawns a <stasis/>Stasis Crystal on impact.\n\nThis explosive jump also releases an expanding ? meter radius <stasis/>Stasis Wave that <stasis/>Freezes enemies on contact <pvp [Slows for ? seconds] />.\n\nShrapnel Kills do not charge Blastwave Striders.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-12T22:33:27.040Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
